To dowload code:
  Open terminal
  run "git clone https://github.com/willbubger/TeelCode.git"
    That’ll create a folder like: /Users/yourname/Desktop/TeelCode/
  Open Unity Hub
    Click Add project from disk
    Navigate to the cloned folder
    Select it
    Unity will import and generate all the local cache files

To commit changes:
  Navigate to "/Users/yourname/Desktop/TeelCode/" in your terminal
  git add .
  git commit -m "Added new question system"
  git push origin main

BEFORE EDITING ANYTHING:
  run "git pull origin main" on your teelcode folder to make sure you're editing the most up to date version
